    "profile.trainsHere.label" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the switch on the profile (web My profile TW-09, iOS and Android Profile TM-04), one per workspace where the person is Owner. On means they also train there and show as a trainer (F005). {workspace} is the workspace name, e.g. John's Gym. It talks about training, never about profiles.",
